  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2022</mn></msup><mn>15</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2022</mn></msup><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>1011</mn></msup><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup><mn>15</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>15</mn></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>15</mn></mfenced><mn>1010</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1011</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>15</mn></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>15</mn></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>15</mn></mfenced><mn>1010</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1010</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>15</mn></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Fractional part of<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2022</mn></msup><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>",
